{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.poster.avif?t=1765194562\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.webm?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.mp4?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mystical realm of medieval Japan, a confident young warrior named Takashi Raizen faces a harrowing quest. While defending his village from a ferocious boar-demon, Takashi is cursed and left with no choice but to embark on a journey to the distant western forest. Legends speak of the God of Thunder residing within, a powerful deity who holds the key to defeating the most vicious demon on Earth and breaking the curse that threatens Takashi\u2019s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Takashi travels the captivating landscapes, he becomes entangled in a war between the forest gods and the hideous demon, revealing the depths of his own courage and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.poster.avif?t=1765194562\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.webm?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.mp4?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat blends precision swordplay with mystical powers granted by the gods, pushing you to master timing, strategy, and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, exploration plays a key role. Every corner of the western forest tells a story. Players can forge bonds with benevolent spirits, and unlock forgotten techniques to aid in the fight against overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every choice made, the weight of destiny falls heavier on Takashi\u2019s shoulders. Will you rise as a savior of the land or fall prey to the darkness that seeks to consume it? <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.poster.avif?t=1765194562\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.webm?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/03bf0464cc3153cc7b3ab2e5d6d0c138.mp4?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><br><br> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Sword Combat</strong> \u2013 Master fast-paced melee battles with precise timing, combos, and counterattacks against relentless demonic foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mythical Abilities</strong> \u2013 Harness the power of ancient deities, unlocking elemental powers and devastating special moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive World</strong> \u2013 Explore dense forests, sacred temples, towering pagodas, and fortified castles inspired by Japanese folklore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Battles</strong> \u2013 Face off against colossal demons and legendary creatures in high-stakes encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative Depth</strong> \u2013 Experience a tale of courage, sacrifice, and destiny in a world caught between gods and monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your abilities, acquire unique weapons, and shape Takashi\u2019s path to victory.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041450?t=1765194562","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041450?t=1765194562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/8a776f591bd2a5d24be24b01503d634742126e42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765194562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/8a776f591bd2a5d24be24b01503d634742126e42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765194562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.poster.avif?t=1765194562\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.webm?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/f6168f237c09638d1dcbb6518015ca6a.mp4?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mystical realm of medieval Japan, a confident young warrior named Takashi Raizen faces a harrowing quest. While defending his village from a ferocious boar-demon, Takashi is cursed and left with no choice but to embark on a journey to the distant western forest. Legends speak of the God of Thunder residing within, a powerful deity who holds the key to defeating the most vicious demon on Earth and breaking the curse that threatens Takashi\u2019s life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Takashi travels the captivating landscapes, he becomes entangled in a war between the forest gods and the hideous demon, revealing the depths of his own courage and strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.poster.avif?t=1765194562\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.webm?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041450/extras/57bd62312c46be02def43df575cd96b7.mp4?t=1765194562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The combat blends precision swordplay with mystical powers granted by the gods, pushing you to master timing, strategy, and adaptability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond combat, exploration plays a key role. Every corner of the western forest tells a story. Players can forge bonds with benevolent spirits, and unlock forgotten techniques to aid in the fight against overwhelming odds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every choice made, the weight of destiny falls heavier on Takashi\u2019s shoulders. Will you rise as a savior of the land or fall prey to the darkness that seeks to consume it? <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinli